 			<p>Amy smiled, and was mollified at once, saying with a maternal air⁠—</p>
 			<p>“Women should learn to be agreeable, particularly poor ones; for they have no other way of repaying the kindnesses they receive. If you’d remember that, and practise it, you’d be better liked than I am, because there is more of you.”</p>
